00:00:31.619 --> 00:00:37.030
This is why drugs, both legal and illegal,
have been such a huge part of human history.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:42.730
Whether it’s communal experiences like the
ayahuasca used by Amazonian tribes or even

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.859
