00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:10.320
But how far does the influence of drugs stretch
throughout the development of mankind?

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:18.229
Today we look at the surprising history of
drugs.

00:01:18.229 --> 00:01:24.380
The biggest war of all time was largely down
